WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:13.191
Appearance in the docked menu: each choice has its icon, a monitor for Match system, sun and moon for light and dark, fast forward and pause for motion. In a menu three hundred pixels wide or more, they sit side by side.

00:00:14.145 --> 00:00:22.665
Drag the menu narrower than that, and they stack one under another, so every choice stays in view. Widened again, they return to one row.
